  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "Sprite UV and time."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_wave",
        "position": {
          "x": 768,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "`dx = sin(v·freq·2π + t·speed) · amount · weight` shifts every row sideways; a second wave across the width (`dy`) wobbles vertically. The weight `lerp(1, v^falloff, anchor)` is 0 at the base, so a flag or plant stays attached to the ground."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_shake",
        "position": {
          "x": 768,
          "y": 963
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "`step = floor(t·rate)`; a hash of `(step, seed)` gives a random direction in (−1…1)², scaled by *Shake Amount*. The value is constant within a step, so the sprite jolts instead of blurring."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_sample",
        "position": {
          "x": 3350,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 1154
        },
        "text": "`uv' = uv + wave + shake`. The **Sprite Texture** node with *Outside: transparent* returns alpha 0 for UVs outside 0…1, so the sprite never smears its border pixels."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 4708,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Displaced colour and alpha."
      }
    ],
